."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/directedincidencegraphview","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView"}]},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","title":"Hypergraphs"}}}